{# enforcement/templates/punchlist-archive.md.tera — closed half of the punchlist.

   Same ledger, same dedupe and same status precedence as punchlist.md.tera and
   status.md.tera: one row per finding id keeping the last filing, resolved
   before deferred. The two rendered tables partition the findings, so anything
   counting off either file adds up.

   This file is what carries a run's history past convergence. Recon's
   cold-file coverage scan reads archived punchlists to decide which files were
   ever audited, and a converged run leaves no open findings — every archived
   punchlist in this repo has zero OPEN rows. #}
# Punchlist Archive

**Protocol:** {{ protocol.name }} v{{ protocol.version }}
**Run:** {{ template_instance_id | default(value="?") }}
**State:** {{ state.label }}
**Ledger:** {{ ledger_len }} events

Resolved and deferred findings. Open work is in `PUNCHLIST.md`.

{% set findings = events | where_eq(attribute="event_type", value="finding") | unique_by(attribute="fields.id") -%}
{% set resolved_ids = events | where_eq(attribute="event_type", value="finding_resolved") | unique_by(attribute="fields.id") | map(attribute="fields.id") -%}
{% set deferred_ids = events | where_eq(attribute="event_type", value="finding_deferred") | unique_by(attribute="fields.id") | map(attribute="fields.id") -%}

{% for severity in ["CRITICAL", "HIGH", "MEDIUM", "LOW"] -%}
{% set sev_findings = findings | where_eq(attribute="fields.severity", value=severity) -%}
{% set_global closed_in_severity = 0 -%}
{% for e in sev_findings -%}
{% if resolved_ids is containing(e.fields.id) or deferred_ids is containing(e.fields.id) -%}
{% set_global closed_in_severity = closed_in_severity + 1 -%}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% if closed_in_severity > 0 -%}

## {{ severity }}

| ID | Category | Location | Perspective | Description | Status |
|----|----------|----------|-------------|-------------|--------|
{% for e in sev_findings -%}
{% if resolved_ids is containing(e.fields.id) or deferred_ids is containing(e.fields.id) -%}
| {{ e.fields.id }} | {{ e.fields.category }} | {{ e.fields.location | replace(from="|", to="\|") }} | {{ e.fields.perspective }} | {{ e.fields.description | replace(from="|", to="\|") | replace(from="
", to=" ") }} | {% if resolved_ids is containing(e.fields.id) %}RESOLVED{% else %}DEFERRED{% endif %} |
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor %}
